{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-29","kind":"proposition","title":"平行线性质：内错角、同位角与同旁内角","englishTitle":"A straight line falling on parallel straight lines makes the alternate angles equal to one another, the exterior angle equal to the interior and opposite angle, and the interior angles on the same side equal to two right angles.","book":1,"number":29,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.29","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.29/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":29,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","contentId":"euclid-1-29","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dcacb14635bb72cab2518013f8beb9fcfab7816fa7d48d0944c056dde688c8c0","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-29.statement","euclid-1-29.construction.1","euclid-1-29.proof.1","euclid-1-29.proof.2","euclid-1-29.construction.2","euclid-1-29.construction.3","euclid-1-29.proof.3","euclid-1-29.proof.4","euclid-1-29.proof.5","euclid-1-29.proof.6","euclid-1-29.construction.4","euclid-1-29.proof.7","euclid-1-29.proof.8","euclid-1-29.conclusion","euclid-1-29.historical.1","euclid-1-29.historical.2","euclid-1-29.historical.3","euclid-1-29.historical.4","euclid-1-29.historical.5","euclid-1-29.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-29.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"847dec3f6f60ea121b11913cd81416511e301cd0a85c2bc84e3c856792bab0a7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"A straight line falling on parallel straight lines makes the alternate angles equal to one another, the exterior angle equal to the interior and opposite angle, and the interior angles on the same side equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线相交平行直线使内错角线等同,外部角等于不相邻的内角,内角等于两直角。（相关点与线段：A）"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行线有他直线交加其上则内相对两角必等外角与同方相对之内角亦等同方两内角亦与两直角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条平行线相交并在其上加一条直线，那么内错角必须相等，而同一方的外角也相等于两个方内角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"22299113eb3956b1f5436f0fee922a10a3525ded2009d9171023e055a114a56e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the straight line EF fall on the parallel straight lines AB, CD;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线EF横线相交,平行直线AB、CD横线相交;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2f95cedd484b5254d8780b558c1b27d0898a8be4f9cb584a4b29cd0bb8b2383","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that it makes the alternate angles AGH, GHD equal, the exterior angle EGB equal to the interior and opposite angle GHD, and the interior angles on the same side, namely BGH, GHD, equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,它使内错角 AGH,GHD等值,外部角度EGB等值,相当于不相邻的内角GHD, 内部角度在同一侧,即BGH,GHD等值2 直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9492ec16b86784836c6dbee94aa01b225aefac68fa39df23ea4f7ccd1346317b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the angle AGH is unequal to the angle GHD, one of them is greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,如果AGH角度与GHD角度不相等,其中之一是更大的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bbcae56232ba43a8f66dbed06d2997831909bdb18ca01b3a4a21e1d37ca4a621","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle AGH be greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AGH的角度变得更大"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f58d8a6fd8cd45bb95f04a3f4fc4af29bed0c9b4d818856b38fb9fb3886ba838","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle BGH be added to each; therefore the angles AGH, BGH are greater than the angles BGH, GHD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将BGH角加到每个角;因此,AGH角、BGH角大于BGH角、GHD角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6dca9ceab1753d72df19dad037863b085254b0975b5e59aa913fb5a59deb23b2","citations":["euclid-1-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angles AGH, BGH are equal to two right angles; [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)] therefore the angles BGH, GHD are less than two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度AGH,BGH等于2,直角,因此角度BGH,GHD小于2,直角。 [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b7d8c808d29a6f888f385d89cf0ccf8720dbc2b9de534c57c0fb6f9fa23d847","citations":["euclid-1-post-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But straight lines produced indefinitely from angles less than two right angles meet; [[Post. 5](/principles/euclid-1-post-5)] therefore AB, CD, if produced indefinitely, will meet; but they do not meet, because they are by hypothesis parallel."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但直线从小于2 直角个角度无限期延伸;因此,AB,CD角度如果无限期延伸,将相互相交;但不会相互相交,因为它们是假设平行的。 [[Post. 5](/principles/euclid-1-post-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"989aa06a022275a11fd77659ca8f1bf5afcd9ae62e8682cf2eb9c325175d792d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle AGH is not unequal to the angle GHD, and is therefore equal to it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AGH角度与GHD角度不相容,因此等于GHD角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4f773da14bcfd0686c45aaa9a41d04af451ce1cb6c568c1d0d89e841717c81a8","citations":["euclid-1-15","euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, the angle AGH is equal to the angle EGB; [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] therefore the angle EGB is also equal to the angle GHD. [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,AGH角等于EGB角;因此,EGB角也等于GHD角。 [[I. 15](/principles/euclid-1-15)] [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":10,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be5446dd85ea03fa69b0e8f5ab7038db256defe6fbeea5b1070afa0f3ea42705","citations":["euclid-1-cn-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle BGH be added to each; therefore the angles EGB, BGH are equal to the angles BGH, GHD. [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将BGH角加到每个角;因此,EGB角和BGH角等于BGH角和GHD角。 [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e9eb6042258576e41640aee2c2b9704ad9573595ad7b68f5c3d88dbd3d83851","citations":["euclid-1-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angles EGB, BGH are equal to two right angles; [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)] therefore the angles BGH, GHD are also equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度EGB,BGH等于2,直角,因此角度BGH,GHD也等于2,直角。 [[I. 13](/principles/euclid-1-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae6c8b45b91798bbf3169cc0b563dd912d85d73497695d89443655b538cd0164","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行线有他直线交加其上则内相对两角必等外角与同方相对之内角亦等同方两内角亦与两直角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条平行线相交并在其上加一条直线，那么内错角必须相等，而同一方的外角也相等于两个方内角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6cda39974189df56639bcad259d84dbd36723847a737b5a504462499449b7b35","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：此反前二题故同前图有甲乙丙丁二平行线加他直线戊巳交于庚于辛题言甲庚辛与丁辛庚内相对两角必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，解释如下：这是前两个问题的相反情况，因此如前图所示，甲乙丙丁 是一条平行线加另一条线，戊巳 与 庚 在 辛 相交。命题解释：甲庚辛 和 丁辛庚 内的两个对顶角必须相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"78cd9a69d9886372fe2413cbfee03849c01b899b5952855d6e4488a45d0037a9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如云不然而甲庚辛大于丁辛庚则丁辛庚加辛庚乙宜小于辛庚甲加辛庚乙矣〈公论四〉夫辛庚甲辛庚乙元与两直角等〈本篇十三〉据如彼论则丁辛庚辛庚乙两角小于两直角而甲乙丙丁两直线向乙丁行必相遇也〈公论十一〉可谓平行线乎"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：如果情况不是这样，那么 甲庚辛 大于 丁辛庚，则 丁辛庚 加 辛庚乙 应该小于 辛庚甲 加 辛庚乙。〈公论四〉 和 辛庚甲辛庚乙 等于两个直角。〈本篇十三〉 根据该论点，则 丁辛庚辛庚乙 的两个角小于两个直角，而 甲乙丙丁 必须满足两条线向 乙丁 移动。〈公论十一〉 可以被认为是平行线吗？"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d6a3f3f42e59cb9b196278b0db25ac510c70b9e3e71a39e6a58fad3f57d7534","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"次解曰：戊庚甲外角与同方相对之庚辛丙内角等论曰：乙庚辛与相对之丙辛庚两内角等〈本题〉则乙庚辛交角相等之戊庚甲〈本篇十五〉与丙辛庚必等〈公论一〉后解曰：甲庚辛丙辛庚两内角与两直角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一个解释如下：戊庚甲 外角等于 庚辛丙 对边的内角。证明如下：乙庚辛 与对边 丙辛庚 内角相等 〈本题〉 然后 乙庚辛 的交角等于 戊庚甲〈本篇十五〉 必须等于 丙辛庚 〈公论一〉。解释如下：甲庚辛丙辛庚 两个内角和两个直角相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":18,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"86e7f3f65d136080ae424583cdd8b9d330a9fc252dfc0bff96d8099b7121316d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：戊庚甲与庚辛丙两角既等〈本题〉而每加一甲庚辛角则庚辛丙甲庚辛两角与甲庚辛戊庚甲两角必等〈公论二〉夫甲庚辛戊庚甲本与两直角等〈本篇十三〉则甲庚辛丙辛庚两内角亦与两直角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：P 戊庚甲 和 庚辛丙 的两个角等于 〈本题〉，并且对于每一个额外的 甲庚辛 角，则 庚辛丙甲庚辛 和 甲庚辛戊庚甲 的两个角必须相等。〈公论二〉 和 甲庚辛戊庚甲 等于两个直角。〈本篇十三〉 然后 甲庚辛丙辛庚 的两个内角也等于两个直角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-29.source","contentId":"euclid-1-29","revisionId":"euclid-1-29@raw-dcacb14635bb72ca","order":19,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ae3ee65ed0ff4363de21a9bf2524d15e8ae50dfff9f0056054279dba1671589","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.29/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.29\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-29:euclid-1-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-29","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-29.proof.3","euclid-1-29.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.29","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2